{"parse": {"title": "灵魂影映-01", "pageid": 119376, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%87%8E%E6%A0%91%E8%8E%93%C2%B7%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0\" title=\"野树莓·灵魂影映\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">灵魂影映-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%B5%E9%AD%82%E5%BD%B1%E6%98%A0-02\" title=\"灵魂影映-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">灵魂影映</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.96.B0.E4.BA.BA.E4.B9.98.E5.8A.A1.E5.91.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"新人乘务员\">新人乘务员</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 新人乘务员</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Stewardess-in-Training</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雪夜，列车平稳地行驶在平原之上。铁道尽头，城镇已在地平线上隐隐显出轮廓。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_bangongchexiang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>站好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-312512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-312512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-312512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>唔……唔……呃啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一团红色的毛线球从她头上掉落，滚到一旁。长长的线的另一端连着列车长手中的棒针。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>针织的手未有半分停顿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>12秒，再来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312521.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312521.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312521.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312521.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312521.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312521.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-312521.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312521.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我的头是圆的，毛线球也是圆的，怎么可能顶着它站30秒？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>你可以，只要你好好站着——你不是已经坚持到12秒了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312518.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-312518.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312518.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312518.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-312518.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312518.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-312518.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312518.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>12秒已经够久了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>哦，野树莓乘务员，我衷心希望你能够有超过12秒的定力——仅仅需要你好好站着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>这不是惩罚，我不喜欢惩罚员工。我只是想让你对以下事项有更清楚的认知——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>列车乘务员的工作，是巡视车厢，维持秩序，提供服务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>不是让你站在过道上和乘客聊天，讲血食怪故事，然后兴起模仿，把自己倒挂在车厢上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>野树莓<b>乘务员</b>，我不记得自己什么时候雇佣了一只蝙蝠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在“乘务员”三个字上加了重音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>希望你能熟读列车工作手册，至少让你的两只脚好好站在地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">告死鸟：</div><div>现在，把毛线捡起来，卷好，我要开始计时了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……唉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:83%\">可是乘客们明明都很开心啊……</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她低声咕哝着，还是听话地弯下腰去，将滚落的毛线卷好，小心翼翼地顶到自己的头上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>漫长的夜里，“多瑙黎明号”的车轮卷起翻飞的雪花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车上乘客有的酣睡，有的写信，有的正细细地为圣诞礼物的包装纸折好褶子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_chexiangyewa\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_chexiangyewa\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_chexiangyewa.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>新人乘务员捂着发酸的脖子，悄声经过乘客的车厢，中途为一位睡梦中的乘客捡起掉落的毛毯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她打了个哈欠，很快忘记顶毛线球时的站姿，放松了四肢，舒舒服服地伸了个懒腰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>呼……啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>野树莓！列车长放你回来了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>今天是不是很顺利？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乘务员的手里还拿着空的热水壶，热切地关心新人乘务员的工作培训状况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>唔……还可以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>列车长是不是抽查了列车安全手册？里面的第十条……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两位乘务员轻声细语地聊着天，并肩踱过长长的车厢过道，声量没有惊扰到任何一位乘客。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_aimafangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_aimafangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……她和我说明天要顶两个毛线球！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>这怎么可能做得到嘛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>艾玛，你顶过毛线球吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>咦？我、我没有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>不过，我帮列车长理过毛线，在她很忙的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>无论工作结束时夜有多深，列车长在休息之前总要织一会儿东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小乘务员垂下眼睛，像是陷入安详的回忆之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>你说，列车长为什么一直在织毛线呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>难道她想给火车套一件大毛衣？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到这句话，一旁的伙伴轻笑出声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>列车长每天要处理的事情有很多，一整列“多瑙黎明号”上下所有的运行都在靠她指挥呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>她这样告诉过我——整理毛线就是整理思绪。列车长习惯一边针织一边思考。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>那她要想的事情也太多了吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她望着满屋的针织品，就连桌上最细小的装饰物，都被套上一件精致的针织外套。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我不会再倒挂到车厢里了……我不想再顶毛线球啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>列车长日理万机，希望她大人有大量，尽快忘了我犯的那些“小错误”吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她坐到桌前，打开抽屉，掏出一沓信纸，掌灯，用尖牙咬下钢笔盖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>列车长又让你抄写了吗？列车安全手册……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>唔……不是，那个我后面再抄！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>我要给安娜贝尔她们写信，投到下个车站的邮筒里。圣诞之前，应该可以收到吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>邮递员一般在傍晚到车站取信，明天中午到站投信的话……五天就可以到布达佩斯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小乘务员观察细微，擅长计算车马轮转，很快就得出结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-312510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>太好了！我答应安娜贝尔，信会在平安夜之前到的……上次我已经在信里和她讲完了阿诺德六世的故事……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信件被投入车站邮筒，又从布达佩斯纷飞而来，不知不觉中讲完了血食怪阿诺德一世到六世的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>那接下来就是阿诺德六世的后代——野树莓一世啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312517.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-312517.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312517.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312517.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-312517.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312517.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-312517.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312517.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……哎？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312518.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-312518.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312518.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312518.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-312518.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312518.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-312518.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312518.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>野树莓一世……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾玛：</div><div>怎么啦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>没、没事！对……接下来是野树莓一世的故事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>羽毛笔尖因颤晃掉落一滴墨水，好在笔者反应够快，没让它掉落到洁白的信纸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她凝神思索，对这个故事似乎无法像以前一样脱口成章，侃侃而谈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>……好吧！是时候讲讲本世纪最伟大的血食怪，阿诺德六世的后代——野树莓一世的故事了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>亲爱的、安娜贝尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>血食怪野树莓一世出生于一个强大的血食怪族裔，他们的生活富足、愉悦、和谐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-312501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓：</div><div>在野树莓一世的童年，命运因其早早显露的强大而赋予她考验……嘿，别担心，每个血食怪的一生都要经历考验……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>我亲爱的，嗜血的阿诺德伯爵，是否能邀请您共进晚餐？一同尝尝人类的盛宴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的父亲：</div><div>我的荣幸！不朽的鲜血夫人，血食怪不妨也走进这新新世界！我已闻到美食的香气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>噢，瞧一瞧加入我们晚宴的还有谁？最近名声大噪的新生血食怪——野树莓！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的父亲：</div><div>还有这位……崭露头角的少年血食怪，小尼古拉！真是后生可畏……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>真是一场血食怪的盛世……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>满脸笑容的母亲将餐盘端上铺着陈旧桌布的餐桌。餐盘上盛着一勺豆子，酸白菜及水煮土豆块。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-638701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼古拉：</div><div>哇……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>尊敬的、不朽的鲜血夫人，我可以少要一些豆子吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>野树莓阁下，为何摒弃这人类的豆子？它对血食怪来说并无坏处，况且……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一小缕黑影攀爬上桌沿，变成微小的兔子形状，随后是猫、狗、鹦鹉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>动物的影子栩栩如生，围坐在野树莓的餐盘中，开始啄食其中湿润的灰黄色豆子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>它多么受大家喜爱！一个聪明的血食怪是不会错过任何好处的，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的父亲：</div><div>是了！尊贵的野树莓阁下，我们也曾身披绸缎，食享盛筵，那夜里的光火多么明亮……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的父亲：</div><div>但血食怪的生命总是丰富的，豆子也是其中的一部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>唔……那好吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>这才对了！厉害的血食怪不会只有对鲜血的渴望，我们会永恒与这世界相处……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-638601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的父亲：</div><div>因此更应体会其缤纷美妙，亲爱的野树莓阁下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>好了，请大快朵颐吧，我的孩子们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>母亲指尖神秘术的辉光停止闪烁，那些小而精巧的影子渐渐褪去了，不再打扰进食的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的手上有因磨损而失去光辉的金色戒指，餐盘上也绘有一些精致华美的装饰花纹——这是曾经的安宁、富足仅剩的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磨损的餐盘和桌沿，漏雨水的屋顶，狭小而散发霉味的床铺，以及一对开朗而爱幻想的父母。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——现在，这就是家的全部了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwudating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwudating\"><img alt=\"muwudating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/600px-Cg-muwudating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/900px-Cg-muwudating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/Cg-muwudating.png/1200px-Cg-muwudating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>万籁俱寂，阿诺德五世漫步在他的领地之中……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>动物们纷纷从沉眠之中苏醒，它们嗅闻阿诺德伸过去的手指，知其强大与正义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小小的影子又出现在斑驳的灰色墙角，动物的黑色轮廓在简陋的方寸之间快活地跳跃着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>它们跳呀，叫呀，从黑夜到清晨，为阿诺德带来夜游的自由，为森林归于他庇佑下的和平……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们在影子剧场和母亲温柔的旁白之中昏昏欲睡，</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓦地又被街外划破静夜的枪声惊醒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>妈妈，外面又开始——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>嘘……我的孩子，要安静，我们保持安静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小野树莓：</div><div>他们什么时候走呀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩听话地放低了声音，枪声又起，这次近在咫尺，似乎要穿透薄而脆弱的墙壁。<br />母亲立刻紧紧捂住了她的嘴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敌人占领了他们的城镇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>睡吧孩子，快睡吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>良久，待到枪声不再响起，剩下一片死寂。母亲将手放在孩子的眼睛上，声音颤抖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"638501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"638501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a0/HeadIconSmall-638501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-638501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">野树莓的母亲：</div><div>他们很快就离开……很快……</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "灵魂影映-01"}}